92E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DeepAR 是 Amazon 提出的基于自回归 LSTM 的概率预测模型。它的创新在于：不输出单一预测值，而是输出预测分布的参数（如高斯分布的均值和方差），从而支持概率预测和不确定性量化。DeepAR 还支持多序列联合训练，通过共享模型参数在多个相关序列之间迁移知识。</p>\n<p>GRU（Gated Recurrent Unit）是 LSTM 的简化版本，将遗忘门和输入门合并为更新门，减少了参数量。在许多实际场景中，GRU 的性能与 LSTM 相当，但训练速度更快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时序卷积网络\">时序卷积网络</h2><p>时序卷积网络（TCN, Temporal Convolutional Network）通过因果卷积和膨胀卷积在时间序列上实现高效的模式提取。因果卷积确保模型只使用过去的信息预测未来，膨胀卷积通过指数增长的膨胀率在有限层数内覆盖超长的感受野。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TCNConfig {&#10;  inputChannels: number;&#10;  outputChannels: number;&#10;  kernelSize: number;&#10;  numLayers: number;&#10;  dilationBase: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeReceptiveField(config: TCNConfig): number {&#10;  let receptiveField = 1;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; config.numLayers; i++) {&#10;    const dilation = config.dilationBase ** i;&#10;    receptiveField += (config.kernelSize - 1) * dilation;&#10;  }&#10;  return receptiveField;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function causalConv1d(input: number[], kernel: number[], dilation: number): number[] {&#10;  const output: number[] = [];&#10;  const kLen = kernel.length;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; input.length; i++) {&#10;    let sum = 0;&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; kLen; j++) {&#10;      const idx = i - j * dilation;&#10;      if (idx &gt;= 0) {&#10;        sum += input[idx] * kernel[j];&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    output.push(sum);&#10;  }&#10;  return output;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCNConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  inputChannels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  outputChannels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kernelSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  numLayers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dilationBase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</s